            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Andrea M\nRovigo, Italy1 contribution\n0\nSummer dinner\nAug 2025 • Couples\nExcellent traditional dishes \nLinh Vu and Thinh great hosts great Service and friendly, we recommend the restaurant on the top floor of the Hotel which also offers a nice view of the lake\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten August 17, 2025\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Andrea M,\n\nThank you for taking the time to reach out to us with this lovely review.\n\nAt Bellevue Rooftop, we always strive to present our guests with the best quality and value possible, from food to service, and we are so delighted to read that you had a pleasant experience. Your warm words will be shared with the whole team, as it truly is a great source of encouragement. \n\nWe sincerely hope we will have another opportunity to serve you in the near future.\n\nKind regards, \nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten October 28, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
