            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Kaz W\nWallington, United Kingdom243 contributions\n0\nGreat food with a view\nJun 2025 • Couples\nGreat service from the moment we sat down. Linh Vu was very attentive and informative about the menu choices. Food was wonderfully tasty and hot\nWritten June 15, 2025\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Kaz W,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your experience at Bellevue Rooftop. \n\nWe are pleased to hear that you enjoyed the food, the view, and the overall service during your visit. Your kind words about Linh Vu’s attentive and informative service are truly appreciated. We will be sure to pass along your compliments to her. It’s always rewarding to know our team’s efforts contributed to a memorable dining experience.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back on your next visit to Hanoi.\n\nWarm regards,\nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
