            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Robyn S\n2 contributions\n0\nWonderful experience!\nJun 2025 • Couples\nMy husband and I stayed at Silk Path Boutique Hotel and enjoyed dining at the Bellevue Rooftop Restaurant. The views were spectacular and the staff were very attentive to all our needs. Linh Vu and Thinh Cao made amazing cocktails and met our every need with style.\nI would highly recommend visiting if you come to Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 10, 2025\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Robyn S,\n\nThank you for your kind review and for choosing to stay with us at Silk Path Boutique Hanoi. We are delighted to hear that you and your husband had a wonderful experience at Bellevue Rooftop.\n\nIt’s a pleasure to know that you enjoyed the spectacular views and attentive service. We will gladly share your compliments with Linh Vu and Thinh Cao as they will be thrilled to know their cocktails and hospitality left a lasting impression.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and look forward to welcoming you back on your next visit to Hanoi.\n\nWarm regards,\nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
