            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Erin C\n3 contributions\n0\n10/10\nMay 2025 • Couples\nBeautiful food with a gorgeous city view. We have thoroughly enjoyed our stay at the silk path hotel. The staff are so lovely and take extra time to really get to know you and help you out. The rooftop restaurant was the cherry on top to our final night in the beautiful Hanoi and we will be sure to stay here again when we return.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 18, 2025\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Erin C,\n\nThank you for your lovely review and for choosing to stay with us at Silk Path Boutique Hanoi. \n\nWe’re delighted to know that your experience was a 10/10 and that Bellevue Rooftop was a memorable highlight to your final night in Hanoi. It’s especially heartening to hear that our team made you feel welcomed and well cared for, as we believe it’s those personal touches that make a stay truly special.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back on your next visit to Hanoi.\n\nWarm regards,\nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten June 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
