            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "John S\nTaichung, Taiwan7 contributions\n0\nGreat Night Cap\nApr 2025 • Friends\nWOW, what a view of Hoen Kiem Lake! It was a beautiful night, my drinks were real drinks not watered down. So I felt like there was good value. Linh vu and Cao Thinh were great hosts. I was really surprised at how awesome the view was. This is a really great place for a night cap in Hanoi even if you're not staying at the Silk Path Boutique. I highly recommend an evening here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 6, 2025\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear JohnS14258,\nWe would like to express our sincere thanks to you for sharing your warm words regarding your experience with us at Bellevue Rooftop.\n﻿It is a delight to know that our staff and the attentiveness in the details of our services as well as the quality of the drinks met your expectations and made your stay memorable. \n﻿The Silk Path team all looks forward to your return when we will strive to make your stay more enjoyable. \n﻿Sincerely, \nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing\nRead more\nWritten May 14, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
