            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Jeff Hensley\n17 contributions\n0\nDining and service at its best!\nOct 2024 • Family\nDining at the Bellevue Rooftop Restaurant was one of our best memories while we were in Hanoi! Julie and her wonderful staff were the best! They each made us feel very welcome and were so attentive to our every need. The food was excellent and the portion size was just right. It’s a beautiful restaurant with a breathtaking view of the Hoan Kiem Lake area. I can highly recommend this wonderful restaurant and its great staff!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 15, 2024\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Jeff Hensley,\nThank you for taking the time to reach out to us with your great feedback regarding your experience at Bellevue Rooftop. \nWe are delighted to read that you enjoyed the service from our caring staff and the food. Julie and the team will be so happy and encouraged by your kind words.\nIt would be our pleasure to have another opportunity to welcome you back soon.\nSincerely, \nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
