            "review_title": "Review at Bellevue Rooftop",
            "review_text": "Chi P\n1 contribution\n0\nAn intimate restaurant overlooking Hoan Kiem Lake\nOct 2024 • Family\nMy family and few friends dined at Bellevue Rooftop, an intimate restaurant on the rooftop of the Silk Path Boutique Hotel, overlooking Hoan Kiem Lake. The ambiance is elegant yet cozy, making it a perfect spot for a special evening. The fusion-style menu is selected yet carefully curated. I highly recommend trying the Festival Soup—it’s a delightful start. I had the chance to try all four main courses, and each one was exceptional! Bellevue Rooftop is a must-visit for anyone looking for a memorable dining experience in Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 15, 2024\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Chi P,\nIt is a delight to receive such a kind review from you, and to know that the lake view, the rooftop's ambiance, and the food met your expectations. The team will be highly motivated by your remarks.\nThank you for sharing your wonderful thoughts with us and we sincerely look forward to your return in the near future.\nBest regards, \nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
