            "review_text": "Tour35257967918\n1 contribution\n0\nLiterally Worth to come back !\nOct 2024 • Family\nWe have been there for our celebration of Vietnamese Women's Day. The family came with 4 adult and 2 little kids, however the staff was awesome with our kids. Their cares, their attitudes are a bonus towards any restaurant in the area of Hanoi. Literally the foods was seasoning well with good decorations, also tasty. My husband had slow roasted beef, properly, and it was really great. If you come over, the must try is their cocktails. They comes with different flavor and unique indigents, my favourite was the dracotomelon with sour flavor, such a great combination. The view is outstanding to look over the Hoan Kiem lake, great for the couple night actually. Overall is worth to come back .\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 13, 2024\nSilk Path Hotels & Resorts\nDear Tour35257967918,\nMany thanks for your wonderful feedback regarding your experience with us at Bellevue Rooftop.\nWe are delighted to read that the service by our staff and the food met your expectations. Your warm words will be shared with the team to serve as an encouragement for the job well done.\nIt would be our pleasure to have another opportunity to welcome you back soon.\n\nSincerely, \nTrinh Linh Chi\nDirector of Marketing.\nRead more\nWritten November 20, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
